# MySimcha Platform — Editor & Agent Rules

## Canonical documentation (always use these)

- `AGENTS.md`
- `CLAUDE.md`
- `docs/product-vision.md`
- `docs/architecture.md`
- `docs/database.md`
- `docs/security.md`
- `docs/api.md`
- `docs/development-guide.md`

Do **not** use files under `docs/archive/` — they are historical duplicates.

## Hard rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md` and the canonical docs listed above.
- Sprint 1–2 completed (identity + in-memory auth rate limiting). Do not implement invitations/events unless asked. Do not introduce Redis unless explicitly approved.
- Keep package boundaries: Prisma → `@mysimcha/database`, Stripe → `@mysimcha/payments`, Cloudinary → `@mysimcha/media`, Twilio → `@mysimcha/notifications`, OpenAI → `@mysimcha/ai`, Google Maps → `@mysimcha/maps`.
- Always scope tenant queries by `organizationId`.
- Validate inputs with Zod; enforce RBAC via `@mysimcha/auth`.
